1
00:01:37,570 --> 00:01:42,920
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,550 --> 00:01:46,000
[Episode 11]

3
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,740
What are you doing?

4
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:02,350
Master.

5
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,680
I now know I was wrong.

6
00:02:09,750 --> 00:02:11,410
Everything that has happened

7
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:12,870
is all my fault.

8
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:17,310
I shouldn't have disobeyed
my parents' orders

9
00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:20,370
and insisted on marrying you
as a concubine.

10
00:02:21,190 --> 00:02:22,920
I shouldn't have counted on you

11
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:24,480
to shield the three of us

12
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,540
from life's harships.

13
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:30,190
It's all my fault.

14
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:34,000
What do you mean?

15
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:38,360
Are you saying you were

16
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,750
blind to marry me?

17
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:45,120
How dare you!

18
00:02:56,310 --> 00:02:57,360
Master.

19
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,120
Master.

20
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:06,150
No matter what,
Zhengjun is your own flesh and blood.

21
00:03:07,030 --> 00:03:09,160
Even if he’s made a thousand mistakes,

22
00:03:09,710 --> 00:03:10,910
you can't just stand by

23
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:12,570
and watch him fend for himself

24
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:14,150
in prison, can you?

25
00:03:15,310 --> 00:03:16,280
Concubine Mei.

26
00:03:16,910 --> 00:03:17,960
Mei Yinghua.

27
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:20,180
Everyone in the residence knows

28
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,700
that I dote on you the most.

29
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:25,800
Otherwise, how would I put up with you

30
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,460
causing trouble all the time?

31
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,120
If I didn't care for

32
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:33,840
that little brat,

33
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,120
why would I personally go to the prison

34
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,400
and give him 70 lashes?

35
00:03:39,630 --> 00:03:41,150
70 lashes?

36
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:43,640
You might as well take his life!

37
00:03:45,150 --> 00:03:46,680
Such a narrow-minded view.

38
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,450
If I didn't give him 70 lashes,

39
00:03:49,450 --> 00:03:50,910
would that guy surnamed Yan

40
00:03:50,910 --> 00:03:52,800
actually believe he was framed?

41
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,430
I saved his life!

42
00:03:55,590 --> 00:03:56,800
70 lashes is already

43
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,440
letting him off easy.

44
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:00,970
I don't care.

45
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:03,960
Either way, you must get him out of prison.

46
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,520
If you don't save Zhengjun,

47
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:10,370
I'll die right in front of you.

48
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:11,960
Then die.

49
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,910
Master!

50
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,430
The Eldest Young Master is back!

51
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:25,230
The Eldest Young Master is back!

52
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,240
The Eldest Young Master is back!

53
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:29,040
The Eldest Young Master is back!

54
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:30,800
Mother!

55
00:04:32,370 --> 00:04:35,550
[Xie's Eldest Young Master, Xie Zhenglun]

56
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,150
Mother!

57
00:04:55,510 --> 00:04:56,720
Get up.

58
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,930
My son has grown taller.

59
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:11,920
This is Zhenglun, the Eldest Brother
everyone talks about.

60
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:14,500
I have been thinking about you every day.

61
00:05:21,270 --> 00:05:22,600
Zhengjun, he...

62
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:29,510
Mother.

63
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:33,150
I'm here.

64
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,360
It seems

65
00:05:36,870 --> 00:05:38,870
he is Concubine Mei's weakness.

66
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:46,120
Xie Shu

67
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:51,260
wants me to take the fall for this
corruption charge all by myself.

68
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,680
Yan Rui

69
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:57,420
wants to use my life
in exchange for merits.

70
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,510
Fine.

71
00:06:11,390 --> 00:06:12,630
Then we shall

72
00:06:14,630 --> 00:06:17,040
gamble our lives with them once more.

73
00:06:45,390 --> 00:06:46,630
Second Young Master,

74
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,630
your time has come.

75
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:56,870
Lord Yan!

76
00:06:56,870 --> 00:06:57,760
Save me!

77
00:06:58,630 --> 00:07:01,000
I have accepted Lord Wei's gift
on his behalf.

78
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,240
As for Second Young Master Xie,

79
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,500
you must not touch him.

80
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:31,220
What else do you have up your sleeves?

81
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:47,260
Don't kill him!

82
00:08:55,990 --> 00:08:58,790
[Shen Che]

83
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:09,670
Here are the noodles you wanted.

84
00:09:09,670 --> 00:09:11,480
I made this for you myself.

85
00:09:11,870 --> 00:09:12,720
Eat up.

86
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,920
Your skills have regressed.

87
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,960
That's for sure.

88
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:21,830
As a corrupt official

89
00:09:21,870 --> 00:09:23,600
living a life of pleasure and
leisure every day,

90
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:26,060
my skills naturally can't compare to yours.

91
00:09:28,750 --> 00:09:30,550
You are all alone in the capital.

92
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,840
It must have been hard on you.

93
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,360
Eat slowly.

94
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,460
Since you are back,

95
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,420
why don't you stay for a few more days?

96
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:52,080
I've prepared a room for you.

97
00:09:58,870 --> 00:10:00,530
I still have some things to do.

98
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,120
After you finish eating,

99
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:02,790
rest early.

100
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:17,000
I recall ordering that

101
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:18,970
during the lockdown of the Xie Residence,

102
00:10:18,970 --> 00:10:20,900
no one is allowed to enter or leave.

103
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:21,840
Yes.

104
00:10:22,030 --> 00:10:24,490
Then thank you for doing me a favor,
Lord Yan.

105
00:10:24,870 --> 00:10:26,910
So you're relying on my authority
to throw your weight around now.

106
00:10:26,910 --> 00:10:27,600
Tell me.

107
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:30,090
What brings you here so late at night?

108
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:34,110
If you can't give me a convincing reason,

109
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,850
I'll escort you back
to the residence myself.

110
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,260
Since I left Chen's Tea House,

111
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,670
it's been a long time since

112
00:10:42,670 --> 00:10:45,330
I had osmanthus candy with
such a strong flavor.

113
00:10:45,630 --> 00:10:47,000
Miss, don't tell me you

114
00:10:47,150 --> 00:10:49,240
went through all the trouble of
escaping from the residence

115
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,840
just to trick me out of candy.

116
00:10:51,070 --> 00:10:52,070
What's up?

117
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:54,000
You wanted to see me?

118
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:54,600
Yes.

119
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:55,640
I missed you.

120
00:10:59,510 --> 00:11:00,540
At the same time,

121
00:11:00,630 --> 00:11:02,490
I also want to tell you something.

122
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,010
Lord Yan,

123
00:11:05,630 --> 00:11:07,290
can you withdraw your troops?

124
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,480
What a letdown.

125
00:11:09,870 --> 00:11:11,480
I put on such a big show

126
00:11:11,790 --> 00:11:13,720
just to be able to see you every day.

127
00:11:14,390 --> 00:11:15,720
If I withdraw my troops,

128
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:18,250
wouldn't that put me far away from you?

129
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:29,790
♪ The immortal with green hair ♪

130
00:11:31,990 --> 00:11:39,790
♪ Lazy and flirtatious ♪

131
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:40,990
What's wrong?

132
00:11:40,990 --> 00:11:45,210
♪ Drinking toasts ♪

133
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:44,000
Xie Shu said

134
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:47,200
that the first time he met my mother,

135
00:11:49,030 --> 00:11:50,830
she was singing Tale of the Pipa.

136
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,630
The way her water sleeves danced

137
00:11:59,390 --> 00:12:05,380
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

138
00:12:02,390 --> 00:12:04,250
looked exactly like a butterfly.

139
00:12:05,530 --> 00:12:11,510
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

140
00:12:11,150 --> 00:12:12,030
Unfortunately,

141
00:12:11,610 --> 00:12:16,900
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

142
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:15,920
I've never heard my mother sing opera.

143
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:23,020
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

144
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:21,150
I wonder if it's really

145
00:12:22,390 --> 00:12:23,840
as beautiful as he described.

146
00:12:23,090 --> 00:12:29,280
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

147
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,270
My mother once said

148
00:12:29,310 --> 00:12:35,570
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

149
00:12:30,390 --> 00:12:33,390
she also yearned for an unwavering love.

150
00:12:35,670 --> 00:12:41,960
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

151
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,790
But ever since I can remember,

152
00:12:39,870 --> 00:12:41,800
she had became a different person.

153
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:47,880
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

154
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,820
She stopped singing opera

155
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,600
and no longer had any desires.

156
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:54,070
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

157
00:12:54,090 --> 00:13:00,190
♪ I wonder, is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

158
00:12:57,030 --> 00:12:58,160
In this inner court,

159
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,360
there lived so many women.

160
00:13:00,210 --> 00:13:06,430
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
oflife and death ♪

161
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:05,750
My mother was just one of them.

162
00:13:06,450 --> 00:13:12,130
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

163
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,030
Her smiles,

164
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,120
her tears,

165
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,870
her dreams,

166
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,120
has been buried in

167
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:31,910
this inner courtyard.

168
00:13:41,070 --> 00:13:46,680
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

169
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,760
Xie Qingyuan.

170
00:13:46,770 --> 00:13:52,690
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

171
00:13:52,030 --> 00:13:53,510
Have you ever loved a woman?

172
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:58,270
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

173
00:13:58,350 --> 00:14:04,380
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

174
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,860
What kind of question is that?

175
00:14:04,450 --> 00:14:10,520
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

176
00:14:04,750 --> 00:14:06,030
I just want to know

177
00:14:07,030 --> 00:14:08,490
under what circumstances

178
00:14:08,630 --> 00:14:10,440
a man would give up

179
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:16,820
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

180
00:14:11,630 --> 00:14:13,390
the woman he loves.

181
00:14:16,890 --> 00:14:23,250
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

182
00:14:22,910 --> 00:14:24,030
In order to protect her.

183
00:14:23,270 --> 00:14:29,630
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

184
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:35,810
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

185
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,640
Let my Second Brother go.

186
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:42,110
♪ I wonder, is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

187
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:40,000
Yan Rui.

188
00:14:40,750 --> 00:14:42,030
You clearly know

189
00:14:42,140 --> 00:14:48,200
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
oflife and death ♪

190
00:14:42,670 --> 00:14:45,320
that my Second Brother is simply

191
00:14:45,670 --> 00:14:47,800
the most insignificant little shrimp

192
00:14:48,230 --> 00:14:53,900
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

193
00:14:48,750 --> 00:14:50,610
in this murky waters of Hengtang.

194
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,440
What you want to catch

195
00:14:53,930 --> 00:15:00,110
♪ The wind blows away old memories,
piling them in heaps before the door ♪

196
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:56,220
is the big fish behind him, right?

197
00:14:59,270 --> 00:15:00,000
Am I right?

198
00:15:00,130 --> 00:15:06,110
♪ No one speaks for anyone else ♪

199
00:15:06,350 --> 00:15:12,150
♪ Which page is a missed opportunity,
and which holds my hopes? ♪

200
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:14,790
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

201
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,870
His Lordship has ordered

202
00:15:18,870 --> 00:15:20,130
to withdraw the guards

203
00:15:20,150 --> 00:15:20,810
and return.

204
00:15:21,350 --> 00:15:22,690
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

205
00:15:21,390 --> 00:15:22,080
Yes, Sir!

206
00:15:23,910 --> 00:15:25,390
Thank you, Lord Yan.

207
00:15:26,670 --> 00:15:27,440
Zhenglun.

208
00:15:27,910 --> 00:15:28,550
Yes.

209
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:31,600
Take your brother to rest and recover.

210
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:34,120
Yes, Father.

211
00:15:42,870 --> 00:15:44,930
A trip to the Criminal Justice Office

212
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,440
has taken a heavy toll on him.

213
00:15:48,270 --> 00:15:50,750
Second Brother cares most about
preserving his reputation.

214
00:15:50,750 --> 00:15:53,150
When has he ever been subject to
such injustice?

215
00:15:53,150 --> 00:15:56,440
Second Young Master Xie was the victim of
an assassination attempt yesterday.

216
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:58,700
It looks like he is still a little shaken.

217
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,240
Lord Xie,

218
00:16:00,630 --> 00:16:03,430
please prepare some
calming herbal soups for him.

219
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:05,450
Did you say... assassination?

220
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,010
What do you mean?

221
00:16:10,510 --> 00:16:13,220
I suppose since the case is
about to be solved,

222
00:16:13,670 --> 00:16:15,670
someone wanted to make a 
last-ditch attempt.

223
00:16:15,670 --> 00:16:17,200
But rest assured, Lord Xie.

224
00:16:17,390 --> 00:16:18,320
Your son is fine.

225
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:20,870
He only suffered some minor injuries

226
00:16:20,870 --> 00:16:22,130
and a little hardship.

227
00:16:23,510 --> 00:16:24,840
The hardship...

228
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:27,080
is also his own fault.

229
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,030
Indeed.

230
00:16:30,270 --> 00:16:32,390
Second Young Master is young and ignorant.

231
00:16:32,390 --> 00:16:34,190
He fell for Guo Baofeng's tricks

232
00:16:34,790 --> 00:16:36,920
and resold the disaster relief grain.

233
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,220
Although he is guilty,

234
00:16:38,670 --> 00:16:40,720
fortunately he is not the mastermind.

235
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:43,050
Besides, the money has been compensated.

236
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:44,000
So for this case...

237
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:44,870
Lord Yan.

238
00:16:47,150 --> 00:16:49,050
The tea beside you

239
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:54,120
is lotus seed tea prepared by
my daughter Qingyuan herself.

240
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:58,210
It clears inner heat

241
00:16:58,630 --> 00:16:59,890
and relieves worries.

242
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:02,160
Please have a taste.

243
00:17:28,109 --> 00:17:29,710
The tea brewed by Fourth Lady

244
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:30,960
is indeed delicious.

245
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:36,660
Since that's the case,

246
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,900
how about closing the case after autumn?

247
00:17:41,510 --> 00:17:43,350
That way, everyone will be happy.

248
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:44,740
Sounds great.

249
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,400
Thank you.

250
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,110
No need to thank me.

251
00:17:48,480 --> 00:17:50,140
You should thank Fourth Lady.

252
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:53,680
If she hadn't persuaded me
with her eloquence,

253
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:56,880
I don't think this matter

254
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:59,160
would have been settled so quickly.

255
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:06,200
In that case,

256
00:18:06,310 --> 00:18:08,350
I owe the greatest thanks to myself

257
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:13,680
for having such a wonderful daughter.

258
00:18:19,510 --> 00:18:20,440
Qingyuan.

259
00:18:21,590 --> 00:18:22,680
Lord Yan

260
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:25,030
is generous and righteous.

261
00:18:25,350 --> 00:18:26,640
You should pick a day

262
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,000
to visit the Yan residence

263
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:30,480
and formally thank him in person.

264
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:32,920
Yes.

265
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,240
Indeed.

266
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:35,720
The Eighteen Scholars Camellias

267
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,750
at my residence

268
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,770
are blooming beautifully.

269
00:18:40,030 --> 00:18:41,270
Please stop by whenever

270
00:18:41,270 --> 00:18:42,600
you have some free time.

271
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:44,030
Yes.

272
00:18:59,590 --> 00:19:00,400
Yes.

273
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:31,790
I, Xie Shu, stand ready to
receive the decree.

274
00:19:35,350 --> 00:19:36,640
It seems Lord Xie

275
00:19:37,110 --> 00:19:38,840
knew the Emperor would do this.

276
00:19:41,240 --> 00:19:43,000
Commissioner Hu's influence

277
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:45,480
in the court

278
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:48,090
is truly not to be underestimated.

279
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:49,910
The Emperor's grace is vast.

280
00:19:50,270 --> 00:19:52,310
I am deeply grateful.

281
00:20:05,510 --> 00:20:07,840
Since the Emperor trusts Lord Xie so much,

282
00:20:08,590 --> 00:20:11,720
I'm sure you will not disappoint him

283
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:13,960
and resolve the disaster relief efforts.

284
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:17,960
The corruption and famine in Hengtang
are about to be resolved.

285
00:20:19,030 --> 00:20:21,640
I hope Lord Xie can lend a hand

286
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,240
and help me out.

287
00:20:29,070 --> 00:20:29,880
Of course.

288
00:20:31,310 --> 00:20:32,310
No problem at all.

289
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:49,180
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

290
00:20:48,030 --> 00:20:48,590
Father.

291
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:55,110
What are you doing?

292
00:20:53,870 --> 00:20:55,770
[Moonlight Casts Its Radiance]

293
00:20:56,030 --> 00:20:57,880
Second Brother has already been punished
for his mistakes.

294
00:20:57,880 --> 00:20:59,480
My mother simply loves her son dearly

295
00:20:59,480 --> 00:21:01,640
and didn't mean to be disrespectful to you.

296
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:03,400
Please lift the detention order.

297
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,160
Zhengjun...

298
00:21:05,310 --> 00:21:06,750
still needs his mother's care.

299
00:21:06,750 --> 00:21:09,880
Are there not enough maids and nannies
in the residence?

300
00:21:10,550 --> 00:21:13,120
Do you really need that
good-for-nothing mother of yours

301
00:21:13,120 --> 00:21:14,950
to take care of the injured?

302
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:18,280
My mother has been prideful her whole life.

303
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:19,660
It's really pitiful to

304
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:20,980
treat her this way.

305
00:21:21,350 --> 00:21:22,350
Pitiful?

306
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:24,760
She brought it upon herself.

307
00:21:25,270 --> 00:21:27,170
Only a fool like you

308
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:29,280
would be fooled by her tears.

309
00:21:29,590 --> 00:21:31,160
When I was in the Northern Frontier,

310
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:32,760
how many times did I tell you?

311
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,310
A man

312
00:21:35,070 --> 00:21:36,530
must not be soft-hearted.

313
00:21:38,830 --> 00:21:40,550
We have guests in the residence.

314
00:21:40,550 --> 00:21:42,240
Lord Yan will head out soon.

315
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:44,830
How would it look if he saw you
kneeling here?

316
00:21:44,830 --> 00:21:47,350
Are you trying to embarrass me?

317
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:48,890
I wouldn't dare.

318
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:49,640
Get up.

319
00:21:57,440 --> 00:22:00,240
The Fourth Lady has always
been bold and reckless.

320
00:22:00,510 --> 00:22:01,310
Just now,

321
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:05,200
you even dared to eavesdrop on
the Emperor's secrets.

322
00:22:06,110 --> 00:22:08,710
You knew I was here
but you didn't say anything.

323
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:11,200
That means you tacitly
allowed me to listen in,

324
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:12,730
so it's not eavesdropping.

325
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:15,440
You are just twisting the truth.

326
00:22:16,070 --> 00:22:18,000
I really didn't mean to eavesdrop.

327
00:22:18,030 --> 00:22:19,640
I came to inform Your Lordship

328
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:21,680
that your personal belongings
have been loaded onto the carriage.

329
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:23,080
You can leave at any time.

330
00:22:24,790 --> 00:22:25,440
What?

331
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,000
Burning bridges?

332
00:22:28,070 --> 00:22:29,790
So eager to kick me out?

333
00:22:31,110 --> 00:22:33,680
Who was the one who cited laws one by one

334
00:22:34,350 --> 00:22:35,640
just to make me stay?

335
00:22:37,070 --> 00:22:37,930
Your Lordship,

336
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,890
shouldn't you be magnanimous?

337
00:22:41,070 --> 00:22:43,070
Why bicker with a weak woman like me?

338
00:22:44,550 --> 00:22:45,750
I am not magnanimous.

339
00:22:47,350 --> 00:22:50,010
I'm the kind of person who
nitpicks everything.

340
00:22:52,310 --> 00:22:54,240
Then what do you want, Your Lordship?

341
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:55,350
Wait for my word.

342
00:22:55,960 --> 00:22:58,160
There will be times when I will need you.

343
00:23:13,310 --> 00:23:16,160
The notoginseng powder for
Yuanwai's Residence on the East Street?

344
00:23:16,160 --> 00:23:17,480
How dare you little brat even try to

345
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:20,480
get involved in a deal worth
a hundred taels of silver?

346
00:23:22,270 --> 00:23:23,550
Can you tell the difference
between a 20-head

347
00:23:23,550 --> 00:23:24,880
and a 40-head?

348
00:23:27,790 --> 00:23:29,400
Wenshan panax notoginseng.

349
00:23:29,440 --> 00:23:31,570
The main root looks like a lion's head,

350
00:23:32,110 --> 00:23:33,820
and the cross-section
looks like a chrysanthemum.

351
00:23:33,820 --> 00:23:36,280
It's a shame they overdid it
with the sulfur.

352
00:23:36,310 --> 00:23:38,710
Even the copper scale pan has turned green.

353
00:23:48,310 --> 00:23:49,200
Fine.

354
00:23:49,370 --> 00:23:51,890
Since Fourth Lady knows these herbs,

355
00:23:52,310 --> 00:23:53,170
then do you know

356
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:55,770
the difference between Qingbei and Songbei?

357
00:23:56,160 --> 00:23:57,070
You should know that

358
00:23:57,070 --> 00:23:58,480
one must not be careless with medicine.

359
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,880
One wrong herb and it could mean...

360
00:23:59,880 --> 00:24:01,830
The ones with a crescent shape
in the middle are the highest grade,

361
00:24:01,830 --> 00:24:04,240
while those that vary greatly in size
are of the next grade.

362
00:24:04,240 --> 00:24:05,700
What's so hard about that?

363
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,140
Just like how you

364
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:09,750
delivered 5 taels of bird's nest
to the Xie Residence,

365
00:24:09,750 --> 00:24:11,210
but recorded it as 8 taels.

366
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:14,230
Did you really think the fake bird's nests
made of rice paste

367
00:24:14,230 --> 00:24:15,580
would go unnoticed?

368
00:24:18,030 --> 00:24:21,490
The person recommended by
Second Madam Mei is indeed capable.

369
00:24:22,720 --> 00:24:24,680
Look at your fat face.

370
00:24:25,270 --> 00:24:26,270
You must have been

371
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:29,000
feeding yourself with
all that extra profit, right?

372
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:30,160
You are making baseless accusations!

373
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:32,030
You all are making baseless accusations!

374
00:24:32,030 --> 00:24:34,350
Don't think just because you took over
this pharmacy from Second Madam,

375
00:24:34,350 --> 00:24:35,950
you can do whatever you want.

376
00:24:36,070 --> 00:24:38,160
Who doesn't know that you,
Fourth Lady Xie,

377
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:40,560
have always been at odds with Second Madam?

378
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:43,200
Baseless accusations?

379
00:24:43,680 --> 00:24:46,560
Do you really think
I'm a cold-hearted master?

380
00:24:47,790 --> 00:24:48,350
Come,

381
00:24:48,920 --> 00:24:50,220
listen up.

382
00:24:51,110 --> 00:24:53,310
Besides these substandard herbs,

383
00:24:53,310 --> 00:24:56,160
there's a drawer full of
fake donkey-hide gelatin.

384
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:58,840
And on the third shelf of cabinet C
in the warehouse,

385
00:24:58,840 --> 00:25:00,070
12 bags of Sichuan pepper

386
00:25:00,070 --> 00:25:01,510
are waiting to be mixed with sawdust.

387
00:25:01,510 --> 00:25:02,790
Am I right?

388
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:05,930
And your little grandson's

389
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:08,000
tuition at the private academy
in the south of the city

390
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:09,750
is paid from the Xie Residence's
public account, right?

391
00:25:09,750 --> 00:25:11,070
Who approved this?

392
00:25:12,680 --> 00:25:13,410
How dare you!

393
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:15,110
So you're just here to cause trouble, huh?

394
00:25:15,110 --> 00:25:16,310
-I’ll…
-Guards!

395
00:25:22,080 --> 00:25:24,410
Hurry up, grab your employment contract,

396
00:25:25,030 --> 00:25:26,110
and get out of here!

397
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:32,730
Bullying the outnumbered?

398
00:25:32,750 --> 00:25:33,740
Just you wait!

399
00:26:18,110 --> 00:26:19,160
My son.

400
00:26:21,350 --> 00:26:23,410
Your father has agreed to let you out.

401
00:26:27,880 --> 00:26:29,560
The Xie family is safe.

402
00:26:34,150 --> 00:26:35,880
As for this Fourth Lady,

403
00:26:36,250 --> 00:26:37,940
if you truly love her

404
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:40,040
and refuse to marry anyone else,

405
00:26:41,270 --> 00:26:42,670
I won't stop you anymore.

406
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:45,590
I just beg you not to

407
00:26:45,610 --> 00:26:47,670
torture yourself like this anymore.

408
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,000
Okay.

409
00:26:52,440 --> 00:26:53,750
Go wash up and change your clothes.

410
00:26:53,750 --> 00:26:55,240
How can you go to see your loved one

411
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:57,010
without looking your best?

412
00:27:03,790 --> 00:27:04,850
Thank you, Mother.

413
00:27:20,480 --> 00:27:21,410
Young Master Li.

414
00:27:22,030 --> 00:27:25,160
A few pearls have accidentally fallen off
the jade and pearl hairpin

415
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:27,290
you left at the Xie Residence last time

416
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:29,350
I have sent someone to repair it.

417
00:27:29,640 --> 00:27:30,640
When it is fixed,

418
00:27:30,760 --> 00:27:37,840
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

419
00:27:30,790 --> 00:27:33,070
I will send someone to
deliver it back to your residence.

420
00:27:33,070 --> 00:27:33,680
Why?

421
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:35,840
Don't you like it, Qingyuan?

422
00:27:36,030 --> 00:27:36,590
Yes.

423
00:27:37,030 --> 00:27:37,890
I don't like it.

424
00:27:37,910 --> 00:27:44,620
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

425
00:27:44,800 --> 00:27:52,140
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

426
00:27:46,030 --> 00:27:47,590
By not liking it,

427
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:49,960
I don't mean the hairpin is not good.

428
00:27:51,070 --> 00:27:52,720
It deserves a better owner

429
00:27:52,270 --> 00:27:59,320
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

430
00:27:53,110 --> 00:27:54,400
who will cherish it.

431
00:27:58,550 --> 00:27:59,960
Just like you, Young Master Li.

432
00:27:59,460 --> 00:28:06,630
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

433
00:28:00,960 --> 00:28:02,640
All the ladies in Hengtang

434
00:28:03,030 --> 00:28:05,490
say you are the best candidate
for a husband,

435
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:07,030
because you are outstanding.

436
00:28:06,820 --> 00:28:16,650
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

437
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,590
But to like someone,

438
00:28:09,960 --> 00:28:12,090
you don't need them to be outstanding.

439
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:14,830
Just liking them is enough.

440
00:28:17,380 --> 00:28:24,390
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

441
00:28:22,830 --> 00:28:23,750
But I like you.

442
00:28:24,420 --> 00:28:31,420
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

443
00:28:24,550 --> 00:28:26,000
Since the Shangsi Festival,

444
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:28,260
I have decided I will marry no one but you.

445
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:31,110
Can you tell me why

446
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:32,720
you are always trying to push me away?

447
00:28:31,450 --> 00:28:34,940
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

448
00:28:33,030 --> 00:28:34,400
Am I inadequate in any way

449
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:35,270
that made you hate me?

450
00:28:34,970 --> 00:28:38,630
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

451
00:28:38,660 --> 00:28:44,930
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

452
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:41,480
I don't hate you.

453
00:28:44,070 --> 00:28:45,480
But it doesn't mean

454
00:28:46,270 --> 00:28:48,070
that I will definitely like you.

455
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:53,350
When it comes to interacting with others,

456
00:28:53,350 --> 00:28:55,880
isn’t being at ease
the most important thing?

457
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:57,480
It's true.

458
00:28:58,480 --> 00:29:00,550
I am a concubine-born daughter
of the Xie family.

459
00:29:00,550 --> 00:29:01,880
After wandering in exile for many years,

460
00:29:00,650 --> 00:29:07,050
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

461
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:04,030
I need to tread lightly

462
00:29:04,350 --> 00:29:06,550
just to survive in this house.

463
00:29:07,170 --> 00:29:13,890
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

464
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:08,640
But Young Master Li,

465
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:11,600
although I live in such an environment,

466
00:29:11,750 --> 00:29:14,030
it doesn't mean I need a man

467
00:29:14,060 --> 00:29:21,740
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

468
00:29:14,270 --> 00:29:16,550
or a marriage to save me.

469
00:29:17,440 --> 00:29:19,100
Do you understand what I mean?

470
00:29:21,910 --> 00:29:28,880
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

471
00:29:29,040 --> 00:29:36,350
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

472
00:29:36,430 --> 00:29:46,730
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

473
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:44,000
Just like this beam of light,

474
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,350
to me,

475
00:29:47,180 --> 00:29:54,100
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

476
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:52,350
it means nothing.

477
00:29:54,220 --> 00:30:01,340
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

478
00:30:01,370 --> 00:30:04,740
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

479
00:30:01,440 --> 00:30:02,040
It's okay.

480
00:30:03,030 --> 00:30:04,630
I will always be by your side.

481
00:30:04,770 --> 00:30:08,430
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

482
00:30:08,520 --> 00:30:14,920
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

483
00:30:12,110 --> 00:30:12,830
Trust me,

484
00:30:13,310 --> 00:30:15,570
one day I'll let you see my true feelings.

485
00:30:19,330 --> 00:30:26,100
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

486
00:30:24,780 --> 00:30:32,260
[Frugality Cultivates Virtue]

487
00:30:26,250 --> 00:30:33,590
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

488
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:32,000
Where were we?

489
00:30:32,510 --> 00:30:33,770
We were talking about the ledger.

490
00:30:33,770 --> 00:30:36,730
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

491
00:30:34,350 --> 00:30:35,550
Who is that?

492
00:30:36,510 --> 00:30:37,200
Who?

493
00:30:36,870 --> 00:30:40,300
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

494
00:30:39,550 --> 00:30:40,550
The two of them on the bridge.

495
00:30:40,430 --> 00:30:46,920
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

496
00:30:44,440 --> 00:30:46,300
The Fourth Lady of the Xie family.

497
00:30:47,070 --> 00:30:48,400
She's a knife in my hand.

498
00:30:53,590 --> 00:30:54,440
Fine.

499
00:30:55,830 --> 00:30:58,630
Just don't let the knife
cut your own hand instead.

500
00:30:59,200 --> 00:31:00,400
I know what I'm doing.

501
00:31:01,200 --> 00:31:02,130
It's no big deal.

502
00:31:03,200 --> 00:31:04,440
I won't let her

503
00:31:04,680 --> 00:31:06,110
get in the way of our plan.

504
00:31:07,270 --> 00:31:08,670
Don't you dare touch her.

505
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:15,240
Yan.

506
00:31:15,680 --> 00:31:16,350
Dear.

507
00:31:16,590 --> 00:31:19,550
I prepared some candies for you.

508
00:31:19,550 --> 00:31:20,410
Take them home.

509
00:31:20,920 --> 00:31:22,680
This is sugar pastry.

510
00:31:22,880 --> 00:31:24,680
When there's sugar, there's joy

511
00:31:27,110 --> 00:31:28,680
This is lotus seed candy.

512
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:31,160
More sons, more blessings.

513
00:31:37,350 --> 00:31:38,750
You two continue to chat.

514
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:41,000
I'm going to make some sugar syrup.

515
00:31:41,000 --> 00:31:42,060
Thank you, Granny.

516
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:47,410
What does "more sons, more blessings"
even mean?

517
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:51,640
You are not allowed to have it.

518
00:31:51,640 --> 00:31:52,300
Why?

519
00:31:52,750 --> 00:31:54,240
Could Granny have poisoned it?

520
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:56,030
Shouldn't you give me some reward for

521
00:31:56,030 --> 00:31:58,160
meeting you in the middle of the night?

522
00:31:58,920 --> 00:32:00,790
What is it, Lord Yan?

523
00:32:03,510 --> 00:32:04,970
There is indeed something

524
00:32:05,030 --> 00:32:06,310
I need you to do for me.

525
00:32:08,920 --> 00:32:10,380
It might require someone.

526
00:32:10,920 --> 00:32:11,400
Who?

527
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:12,680
Li Congxin.

528
00:32:17,680 --> 00:32:19,880
Please trouble me with something else.

529
00:32:20,030 --> 00:32:23,430
I don't stand a chance with
the Marquis of Danyang household.

530
00:32:24,070 --> 00:32:25,870
Others might not be able to do it.

531
00:32:26,110 --> 00:32:27,880
But with your intelligence

532
00:32:28,270 --> 00:32:30,640
and your relationship with Young Master Li,

533
00:32:30,640 --> 00:32:32,240
isn't this a piece of cake?

534
00:32:33,480 --> 00:32:35,720
I am not close to Young Master Li.

535
00:32:37,510 --> 00:32:38,480
I'm afraid

536
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:40,480
he wouldn't be up to the task.

537
00:32:40,880 --> 00:32:41,510
Is that so?

538
00:32:43,680 --> 00:32:45,540
When the Xie family was in danger,

539
00:32:45,880 --> 00:32:48,160
your so-called "not close" Young Master Li

540
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:50,220
came to propose without hesitation.

541
00:32:51,830 --> 00:32:52,510
Forgot?

542
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:53,880
Even I was moved.

543
00:32:58,070 --> 00:32:59,330
Looking at it this way,

544
00:32:59,750 --> 00:33:02,640
Young Master Li is simple
and straightforward.

545
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:04,640
He never hides anything.

546
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:06,640
He is indeed a good match.

547
00:33:06,830 --> 00:33:08,230
At least he is better than

548
00:33:09,550 --> 00:33:12,590
some old foxes who have
a dozen tricks up their sleeves.

549
00:33:12,590 --> 00:33:14,590
Even when we sit down for a cup of tea,

550
00:33:14,790 --> 00:33:18,190
we’re still suspicious of each other
and testing the waters.

551
00:33:21,270 --> 00:33:22,000
Shopkeeper!

552
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:26,380
What kind of snacks
do you have in the shop today?

553
00:33:29,750 --> 00:33:31,440
Let me have a look.

554
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:35,590
We have a great variety here.

555
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:36,880
Sir,

556
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:37,790
from the sound of it,

557
00:33:37,790 --> 00:33:39,980
you've never been to our shop before.

558
00:33:40,590 --> 00:33:41,180
Not bad.

559
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:43,850
How long has this shop been opened?

560
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:46,500
I've been here for half of my life.

561
00:33:46,640 --> 00:33:48,510
Foxes are skilled at
winning people's hearts.

562
00:33:48,510 --> 00:33:50,100
You said I'm a fox.

563
00:33:50,960 --> 00:33:52,180
Have you perhaps

564
00:33:52,750 --> 00:33:53,950
lost something to me?

565
00:34:04,110 --> 00:34:06,710
I've long heard that
your shop has good snacks.

566
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:10,400
Even the Imperial Advisor, Lord Yan,

567
00:34:10,400 --> 00:34:11,710
comes here often.

568
00:34:14,960 --> 00:34:15,820
Yan Rui, you...

569
00:34:17,800 --> 00:34:19,230
Today, I must see

570
00:34:19,230 --> 00:34:21,290
what's so special about your snacks.

571
00:34:21,630 --> 00:34:24,030
Aren't you afraid your father's colleague

572
00:34:24,030 --> 00:34:27,090
will find out that we met here
in the middle of the night?

573
00:34:30,280 --> 00:34:32,699
We have poria cakes!

574
00:34:34,190 --> 00:34:35,989
Then I'll have some poria cakes.

575
00:34:40,230 --> 00:34:41,130
My Lord!

576
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:43,150
Poria cakes are in the front hall.

577
00:34:43,150 --> 00:34:43,880
Let's go.

578
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:45,670
I'll take you to pick more snacks.

579
00:34:45,670 --> 00:34:46,480
You know,

580
00:34:46,480 --> 00:34:49,040
we have many kinds of poria cake,

581
00:34:49,190 --> 00:34:51,000
and even fresh glutinous dumplings.

582
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:53,230
I'll pick a few nice things for you today.

583
00:34:53,230 --> 00:34:55,830
These are all great picks for
this time of year.

584
00:34:56,070 --> 00:34:57,400
What should I do?

585
00:34:58,630 --> 00:35:00,290
You have a captivating charm.

586
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:01,800
You give me...

587
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:05,490
butterflies in my stomach.

588
00:35:07,480 --> 00:35:09,510
You sure talk a lot of nonsense.

589
00:35:12,070 --> 00:35:13,360
They haven't left yet.

590
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:16,110
You can't wait to leave, huh?

591
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:17,760
What?

592
00:35:19,480 --> 00:35:20,230
Are you afraid I'll eat you?

593
00:35:19,550 --> 00:35:26,210
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

594
00:35:23,230 --> 00:35:24,920
I'm just your weapon.

595
00:35:25,360 --> 00:35:27,400
Yet, you seem to care so much about
how a weapon feels.

596
00:35:26,240 --> 00:35:33,480
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

597
00:35:28,550 --> 00:35:29,630
Could it be...

598
00:35:29,630 --> 00:35:31,630
that you have other feelings for me?

599
00:35:33,500 --> 00:35:37,380
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

600
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:37,760
I do have special feelings for you.

601
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:40,670
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

602
00:35:40,700 --> 00:35:47,580
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

603
00:35:47,610 --> 00:35:55,680
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

604
00:35:54,230 --> 00:35:55,920
If that's your plan,

605
00:35:55,700 --> 00:36:02,190
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

606
00:35:57,760 --> 00:36:00,020
why are you still afraid of Wei Changyan?

607
00:36:02,210 --> 00:36:06,430
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

608
00:36:02,320 --> 00:36:03,980
When have I been afraid of him?

609
00:36:06,450 --> 00:36:09,670
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

610
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:10,880
Since you call me a fox,

611
00:36:09,700 --> 00:36:16,760
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

612
00:36:11,550 --> 00:36:13,510
I must not disappoint you.

613
00:36:14,920 --> 00:36:16,440
What you just said

614
00:36:16,780 --> 00:36:24,900
♪ I chant and sigh; one cup of spring,
drunk through turns of year ♪

615
00:36:17,030 --> 00:36:19,320
concerns the safety of
the people of Hengtang.

616
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:20,850
So of course I'll do my best.

617
00:36:21,360 --> 00:36:22,820
But there's one more thing

618
00:36:23,190 --> 00:36:24,960
I would like to ask for your help.

619
00:36:24,960 --> 00:36:25,630
Go ahead.

620
00:36:26,150 --> 00:36:28,280
I'll do my best to help you too.

621
00:36:29,230 --> 00:36:31,070
Help me find Cui'er,
the drug-testing slave,

622
00:36:31,070 --> 00:36:32,670
who was sold to the Xie family

623
00:36:32,800 --> 00:36:33,590
28 years ago.

624
00:36:35,000 --> 00:36:35,800
You still want to

625
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:37,460
overturn your mother's case?

626
00:36:38,190 --> 00:36:38,960
I live...

627
00:36:39,920 --> 00:36:41,800
just to clear my mother's name.

628
00:36:42,230 --> 00:36:43,760
I don't mean anything else.

629
00:36:46,710 --> 00:36:47,400
Qingyuan!

630
00:36:49,360 --> 00:36:51,110
Speak of the devil.

631
00:36:51,880 --> 00:36:52,880
Your perfect match is here,

632
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:53,670
Qingyuan.

633
00:36:59,840 --> 00:37:00,590
Young Master Li.

634
00:37:00,590 --> 00:37:02,710
Zhenglun received premium-grade Yuanhong

635
00:37:02,710 --> 00:37:04,280
and invited me over for a drink.

636
00:37:04,280 --> 00:37:05,680
Would you like to join us?

637
00:37:15,280 --> 00:37:16,480
Is someone else here?

638
00:37:21,320 --> 00:37:22,250
Why are you here?

639
00:37:24,440 --> 00:37:25,500
I came to buy snacks

640
00:37:26,150 --> 00:37:27,760
and ran into her.

641
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:30,660
She told me
a lot of nice things about you.

642
00:37:32,320 --> 00:37:32,800
Really?

643
00:37:33,440 --> 00:37:34,030
Yes.

644
00:37:34,630 --> 00:37:36,150
So many nice things.

645
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:37,550
Fourth Lady,

646
00:37:38,590 --> 00:37:40,390
why don't you tell him yourself?

647
00:37:42,710 --> 00:37:43,640
What did you say?

648
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:47,400
If there is nothing else,

649
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:48,630
I'll go back with him.

650
00:37:50,800 --> 00:37:51,400
You are in?

651
00:37:52,760 --> 00:37:53,290
Lord Yan,

652
00:37:53,880 --> 00:37:54,520
see you.

653
00:37:54,710 --> 00:37:55,550
Take care.

654
00:37:56,070 --> 00:37:56,800
I'll take it.

655
00:37:57,110 --> 00:37:57,670
No need.

656
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:00,110
It's okay.

657
00:38:00,110 --> 00:38:00,630
Let me.

658
00:38:00,880 --> 00:38:02,410
Thank you, Young Master Li.

659
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:13,050
What is that?

660
00:38:14,590 --> 00:38:15,190
It's here!

661
00:38:17,550 --> 00:38:18,680
When did you pick it?

662
00:38:20,710 --> 00:38:22,030
It doesn't matter.

663
00:38:22,800 --> 00:38:23,860
What matters is...

664
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:38,100
No matter how sweet the candy,

665
00:38:38,280 --> 00:38:40,590
as long as there's someone
you want but can't get,

666
00:38:40,590 --> 00:38:42,880
you taste nothing but bitterness.

667
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:44,460
You think too much.

668
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:46,940
I have no feelings for her.

669
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:50,450
I just want her to do a few things for me.

670
00:38:50,800 --> 00:38:51,670
As for you,

671
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:53,630
you've been following me all day.

672
00:38:53,630 --> 00:38:54,630
Aren't you tired?

673
00:38:54,840 --> 00:38:56,030
It better be.

674
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:57,880
If you let your romantic interests

675
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:59,440
get in the way of our grand plan,

676
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:01,240
I will definitely kill her first

677
00:39:01,630 --> 00:39:03,230
to prevent future troubles.

678
00:39:03,480 --> 00:39:05,670
You have evidence of Wei Changyan's crimes.

679
00:39:05,670 --> 00:39:07,670
He won't just sit and wait for death.

680
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:09,480
You don't have any bargaining chips.

681
00:39:09,480 --> 00:39:11,760
Be careful not to fumble over
something unexpected.

682
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:12,360
Enough.

683
00:39:13,320 --> 00:39:14,030
Tell me.

684
00:39:14,510 --> 00:39:16,110
How are the grain prices now?

685
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:31,700
I've been at the border for years.

686
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:33,970
It's rare for me to return to Hengtang.

687
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:37,880
I never expected to cross paths
with the two of you

688
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:39,940
and help bring about something good.

689
00:39:42,030 --> 00:39:43,280
Chen's Tea House?

690
00:39:43,630 --> 00:39:46,030
I think the lotus candies given to Qingyuan

691
00:39:46,070 --> 00:39:47,800
may be good as wedding candies.

692
00:39:50,630 --> 00:39:51,760
Actually, that day,

693
00:39:51,800 --> 00:39:54,460
I saw that the Xie family
was in a dire situation.

694
00:39:54,630 --> 00:39:55,550
My rash proposal

695
00:39:55,550 --> 00:39:57,440
was only to force Yan Rui to retreat.

696
00:39:57,440 --> 00:39:58,320
Besides,

697
00:39:59,550 --> 00:40:01,630
I didn't get Qingyuan's agreement.

698
00:40:02,960 --> 00:40:05,090
Let's just treat this matter as a joke.

699
00:40:06,510 --> 00:40:08,240
Since you are so affectionate,

700
00:40:08,630 --> 00:40:09,710
maybe one day,

701
00:40:11,030 --> 00:40:12,360
Qingyuan will be moved.

702
00:40:17,110 --> 00:40:17,910
The two of you,

703
00:40:18,030 --> 00:40:19,560
please don't make fun of me.

704
00:40:20,400 --> 00:40:21,710
I have a lowly status

705
00:40:21,880 --> 00:40:23,800
and wouldn't dare to associate myself
with the Marquis' household.

706
00:40:23,800 --> 00:40:25,760
But you did save me from danger that day.

707
00:40:25,760 --> 00:40:27,880
I will never forget this kindness.

708
00:40:29,710 --> 00:40:31,630
I offer my pure heart with this jade flask.

709
00:40:31,630 --> 00:40:33,550
A toast you, Young Master Li.

710
00:40:34,070 --> 00:40:34,600
Alright.

711
00:40:35,360 --> 00:40:36,590
But please, Qingyuan,

712
00:40:36,590 --> 00:40:39,150
forget my identity from now on,

713
00:40:39,590 --> 00:40:40,650
and forget my name.

714
00:40:41,320 --> 00:40:42,840
Just remember that for you,

715
00:40:42,840 --> 00:40:44,440
my heart is brighter than the moon,

716
00:40:44,440 --> 00:40:45,500
and I'd die for you.

717
00:41:01,190 --> 00:41:02,030
Chunzhi!

718
00:41:06,440 --> 00:41:07,300
Don't drink it.

719
00:41:07,590 --> 00:41:08,450
Second Sister,

720
00:41:08,550 --> 00:41:09,610
What are you doing?

721
00:41:10,110 --> 00:41:11,670
If Baoxian hadn't slipped up

722
00:41:11,670 --> 00:41:13,320
and let me know you were drinking here,

723
00:41:13,320 --> 00:41:14,780
she would have had her way.

724
00:41:14,840 --> 00:41:15,840
Brother Chunzhi,

725
00:41:16,000 --> 00:41:17,930
don't let this bad person fool you.

726
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:18,820
Second Sister,

727
00:41:18,960 --> 00:41:21,620
why are you attacking
your own family like this?

728
00:41:26,960 --> 00:41:27,820
Second Sister.

729
00:41:28,510 --> 00:41:30,150
I have never lied to you,

730
00:41:31,070 --> 00:41:32,930
nor have I lied to Young Master Li.

731
00:41:34,030 --> 00:41:35,800
Is there some misunderstanding

732
00:41:35,800 --> 00:41:37,360
between you and me?

733
00:41:39,400 --> 00:41:40,530
Misunderstanding?

734
00:41:42,550 --> 00:41:45,680
I really don't want to talk about
the ugly things you did.

735
00:41:45,710 --> 00:41:47,230
Since childhood, everyone knew

736
00:41:47,230 --> 00:41:49,360
that Brother Chunzhi and I
were the closest.

737
00:41:49,360 --> 00:41:51,190
But after you showed up?

738
00:41:51,480 --> 00:41:52,480
He's always on your side

739
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:53,880
and even wanted to marry you.

740
00:41:53,880 --> 00:41:54,740
Second Sister,

741
00:41:54,960 --> 00:41:56,420
where is this coming from?

742
00:41:57,150 --> 00:41:57,760
I...

743
00:41:58,230 --> 00:41:59,230
My kindness to you

744
00:41:59,480 --> 00:42:00,800
has always been because
I see you as a sibling,

745
00:42:00,800 --> 00:42:02,150
as my own younger sister.

746
00:42:02,150 --> 00:42:05,210
-I truly have feelings for Qingyuan.
-Young Master Li.

747
00:42:08,710 --> 00:42:10,640
I have no intention of interfering

748
00:42:10,760 --> 00:42:14,090
with the relationship between
Second Sister and yourself.

749
00:42:14,630 --> 00:42:17,110
I have overstepped and offended you today.

750
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:21,360
I apologize to everyone,

751
00:42:22,400 --> 00:42:24,400
and will not disturb you any longer.

752
00:42:26,280 --> 00:42:26,880
Qingyuan!
